<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="dita_output_3">
    <title>DITA output</title>
    <refbody><section>
        <codeblock id="codeblock_czh_cnv_jkc">&amp;lt;map id="alarms"&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;topichead navtitle="Alarms"&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;topicref href="alarm_notifier.dita"/&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;topicref href="alarm_types.dita"/&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/topichead&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/map&amp;gt;
</codeblock>
        <p><b>Result: </b>No DITA topic is created because no source content exists, and a topic
            head is created instead. Any parent folder without an index file becomes a
            navigation-only node.</p>
        <note id="note_l2b_bnv_jkc">Provide an index.md file for every major folder.</note>
    </section></refbody>
</reference>
